<section id="S7.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">7.3 </span>H3: Substantial Coordination Overhead</h3>

<div id="S7.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#S7.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ 7.3 H3: Substantial Coordination Overhead ‣ 7 Results ‣ From Debate to Deliberation:Structured Collective Reasoning with Typed Epistemic Acts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> presents efficiency metrics. The token costs test whether <span id="S7.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">DCI</span>’s deliberative structure comes at a substantial cost.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S7.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S7.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="S7.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Efficiency metrics across systems. Mean tokens per task across all agents and rounds.</span></figcaption>
